{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">著名填詞人黎彼得病逝，終年 76 歲。黎彼得早前與歌神許冠傑合作無間，曾為許冠傑的多首作品填詞，包括《浪子心聲》、《梨渦淺笑》等。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"bkn-20260806112720062-0806_00862_001_03b.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026Rmp2b3bqxP1786012885.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"bkn-20260806112720062-0806_00862_001_03b.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">對於昔日戰友離世，許冠傑大感不捨，特別親筆寫下字條悼念這位好友：<strong>「Peter，一路好走！多謝您為香港樂壇創出無數精彩的作品，你的歌詞通俗而不低俗，打雀英雄傳的傳神，世事如棋的通透，梨渦淺笑的深情，浪子心聲的豁達，我的音樂路上感恩有您！</strong>」</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"instasave.website_766317124_18380459893206394_4864416834417645466_n.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026ulP0lzMv5b1786012905.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"instasave.website_766317124_18380459893206394_4864416834417645466_n.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-06T10:59:33.213440+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":186,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}